# Terraform
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
# Every tfvars variant, not just the two canonical names — `prod.tfvars` or
# `secrets.tfvars` would otherwise be committed in the clear. The .example
# template is re-included below.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Sensitive files
*.pem
*.key
.env
